ass='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja469:9.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja469:9.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja469:10.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja469:10.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja469:10.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja469:10.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja469:11.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja469:11.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja469:11.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja469:11.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja469:12.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja469:12.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja469:12.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja469:12.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja469:13.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja469:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja469:0.2": "Dvādasakanipāta ", "ja469:0.3": "Cūḷakuṇālavagga ", "ja469:0.4": "6. Mahākaṇhajātaka ", "ja469:1.1": "“Kaṇho kaṇho ca ghoro ca, ", "ja469:1.2": "sukkadāṭho pabhāsavā; ", "ja469:1.3": "Baddho pañcahi rajjūhi, ", "ja469:1.4": "kiṁ ravi sunakho tava”. ", "ja469:2.1": "“Nāyaṁ migānamatthāya, ", "ja469:2.2": "usīnaka bhavissati; ", "ja469:2.3": "Manussānaṁ anayo hutvā, ", "ja469:2.4": "tadā kaṇho pamokkhati”. ", "ja469:3.1": "“Pattahatthā samaṇakā, ", "ja469:3.2": "muṇḍā saṅghāṭipārutā; ", "ja469:3.3": "Naṅgalehi kasissanti, ", "ja469:3.4": "tadā kaṇho pamokkhati. ", "ja469:4.1": "Tapassiniyo pabbajitā, ", "ja469:4.2": "muṇḍā saṅghāṭipārutā; ", "ja469:4.3": "Yadā loke gamissanti, ", "ja469:4.4": "tadā kaṇho pamokkhati. ", "ja469:5.1": "Dīghottaroṭṭhā jaṭilā, ", "ja469:5.2": "paṅkadantā rajassirā; ", "ja469:5.3": "Iṇaṁ codāya gacchanti, ", "ja469:5.4": "tadā kaṇho pamokkhati. ", "ja469:6.1": "Adhicca vede sāvittiṁ, ", "ja469:6.2": "yaññatantañca brāhmaṇā; ", "ja469:6.3": "Bhatikāya yajissanti, ", "ja469:6.4": "tadā kaṇho pamokkhati. ", "ja469:7.1": "Mātaraṁ pitarañcāpi, ", "ja469:7.2": "jiṇṇakaṁ gatayobbanaṁ; ", "ja469:7.3": "Pahū santo na bharanti, ", "ja469:7.4": "tadā kaṇho pamokkhati. ", "ja469:8.1": "Mātaraṁ pitarañcāpi, ", "ja469:8.2": "jiṇṇakaṁ gatayobbanaṁ; ", "ja469:8.3": "Bālā tumheti vakkhanti, ", "ja469:8.4": "tadā kaṇho pamokkhati. ", "ja469:9.1": "Ācariyabhariyaṁ sakhiṁ, ", "ja469:9.2": "mātulāniṁ pitucchakiṁ; ", "ja469:9.3": "Yadā loke gamissanti, ", "ja469:9.4": "tadā kaṇho pamokkhati. ", "ja469:10.1": "Asicammaṁ gahetvāna, ", "ja469:10.2": "khaggaṁ paggayha brāhmaṇā; ", "ja469:10.3": "Panthaghātaṁ karissanti, ", "ja469:10.4": "tadā kaṇho pamokkhati. ", "ja469:11.1": "Sukkacchavī vedhaverā, ", "ja469:11.2": "thūlabāhū apātubhā; ", "ja469:11.3": "Mittabhedaṁ karissanti, ", "ja469:11.4": "tadā kaṇho pamokkhati. ", "ja469:12.1": "Māyāvino nekatikā, ", "ja469:12.2": "asappurisacintakā; ", "ja469:12.3": "Yadā loke bhavissanti, ", "ja469:12.4": "tadā kaṇho pamokkhatī”ti. ", "ja469:13.1": "Mahākaṇhajātakaṁ chaṭṭhaṁ. "}, "variant_text": {"ja469:0.1": "", "ja469:0.2": "", "ja469:0.3": "", "ja469:0.4": "", "ja469:1.1": "", "ja469:1.2": "pabhāsavā → patāpavā (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja469:1.3": "", "ja469:1.4": "ravi → dhīra (bj, pts-vp-pli1); vīra (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja469:2.1": "", "ja469:2.2": "usīnaka → usīnara (bj, pts-vp-pli1); usinnara (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja469:2.3": "", "ja469:2.4": "", "ja469:3.1": "", "ja469:3.2": "", "ja469:3.3": "", "ja469:3.4": "", "ja469:4.1": "Tapassiniyo → tapanīyā (mr) ", "ja469:4.2": "", "ja469:4.3": "", "ja469:4.4": "", "ja469:5.1": "", "ja469:5.2": "", "ja469:5.3": "codāya → vodāya (bj, pts-vp-pli1); codaya (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja469:5.4": "", "ja469:6.1": "vede → vedaṁ (mr) ", "ja469:6.2": "yaññatantañca → … tantrañca (bj, pts-vp-pli1); tatrañca (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja469:6.3": "", "ja469:6.4": "", "ja469:7.1": "", "ja469:7.2": "", "ja469:7.3": "Pahū santo → pahū santā (bj); pahusanto (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja469:7.4": "", "ja469:8.1": "", "ja469:8.2": "", "ja469:8.3": "", "ja469:8.4": "", "ja469:9.1": "Ācariyabhariyaṁ sakhiṁ → ācariyabhariyaṁ sakhābhariyaṁ (bj, pts-vp-pli1); ācariyabhāriyaṁ sakhiṁ (sya2ed) ", "ja469:9.2": "pitucchakiṁ → pitucchayaṁ (bj); pitucchasaṁ (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja469:9.3": "", "ja469:9.4": "", "ja469:10.1": "", "ja469:10.2": "", "ja469:10.3": "", "ja469:10.4": "", "ja469:11.1": "", "ja469:11.2": "", "ja469:11.3": "", "ja469:11.4": "", "ja469:12.1": "", "ja469:12.2": "", "ja469:12.3": "", "ja469:12.4": "", "ja469:13.1": ""}, "reference_text": {"ja469:0.1": "", "ja469:0.2": "", "ja469:0.3": "", "ja469:0.4": "", "ja469:1.1": "ms22J_2304, msdiv61, pts-vp-pli4.183, vri68.193", "ja469:1.2": "", "ja469:1.3": "", "ja469:1.4": "", "ja469:2.1": "ms22J_2305, msdiv62", "ja469:2.2": "", "ja469:2.3": "", "ja469:2.4": "", "ja469:3.1": "ms22J_2306, msdiv63, pts-vp-pli4.184", "ja469:3.2": "", "ja469:3.3": "", "ja469:3.4": "", "ja469:4.1": "ms22J_2307, msdiv64", "ja469:4.2": "", "ja469:4.3": "", "ja469:4.4": "", "ja469:5.1": "dr27.330, ms22J_2308, msdiv65, sya27.332", "ja469:5.2": "", "ja469:5.3": "", "ja469:5.4": "", "ja469:6.1": "ms22J_2309, msdiv66, ndp22.241", "ja469:6.2": "", "ja469:6.3": "", "ja469:6.4": "", "ja469:7.1": "bj30.426, ms22J_2310, msdiv67", "ja469:7.2": "", "ja469:7.3": "", "ja469:7.4": "", "ja469:8.1": "csp1ed22.249, csp2ed22.249, ms22J_2311, msdiv68", "ja469:8.2": "", "ja469:8.3": "", "ja469:8.4": "", "ja469:9.1": "ms22J_2312, msdiv69", "ja469:9.2": "", "ja469:9.3": "", "ja469:9.4": "", "ja469:10.1": "ms22J_2313, msdiv70", "ja469:10.2": "", "ja469:10.3": "", "ja469:10.4": "", "ja469:11.1": "ms22J_2314, msdiv71", "ja469:11.2": "", "ja469:11.3": "", "ja469:11.4": "", "ja469:12.1": "ms22J_2315, msdiv72", "ja469:12.2": "", "ja469:12.3": "", "ja469:12.4": "", "ja469:13.1": "ms22J_2316"}, "keys_order": ["ja469:0.1", "ja469:0.2", "ja469:0.3", "ja469:0.4", "ja469:1.1", "ja469:1.2", "ja469:1.3", "ja469:1.4", "ja469:2.1", "ja469:2.2", "ja469:2.3", "ja469:2.4", "ja469:3.1", "ja469:3.2", "ja469:3.3", "ja469:3.4", "ja469:4.1", "ja469:4.2", "j